WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.762
Here's what Microsoft gives you.

2
00:00:01.762 --> 00:00:04.461
Learn's emergency access
page is the standard:

3
00:00:04.461 --> 00:00:07.941
at least two cloud-only accounts
on the onmicrosoft domain,

4
00:00:07.941 --> 00:00:12.558
strong phishing-resistant sign-in that's
different from your everyday admins,

5
00:00:12.558 --> 00:00:14.973
Global Administrator held permanently,

6
00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:18.950
and exclusion from blocking policies
through one dedicated group.

7
00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:21.494
Then you have to run
them: watch their logs,

8
00:00:21.494 --> 00:00:23.963
and test them at least every ninety days.

9
00:00:23.963 --> 00:00:28.717
Book 04 adopts the same standard
and adds two things of its own:

10
00:00:28.717 --> 00:00:31.940
dual custody, and a
review after every use.
